        <fullName>Account_Research_16jKj000000bxTm</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Retrieves pre-gathered research and intelligence about companies from Account_Intel__c records. Also provides comprehensive daily briefings for sales reps. ROUTING CLAIMS - Use this topic when user asks: tell me about [company], what do we know about, background on, brief me before my meeting at, company intel, account research, what is their situation, daily brief, morning briefing, what is the news, catch me up, market update, start my day, what do I need to know today, morning rundown, whats on my plate. For DAILY BRIEF requests use Daily Brief action. For ACCOUNT INTEL requests use Account Intelligence action. ROUTING EXCLUSIONS - Do NOT use for: deal/opportunity/pipeline/stage/amount (use Pipeline and Deals), log/record/meeting/visited/called (use Activity Logging), updating CRM records (use CRM Data Management), products/line items/quote/quantity (use Pipeline and Deals).</description>
        <developerName>Account_Research_16jKj000000bxTm</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Provide pre-gathered intelligence and research about accounts. This topic has two actions: (1) Account Intelligence - for specific account research and intel, (2) Daily Brief - for a comprehensive morning briefing on market news, company announcements, account updates, and industry trends. Use Account Intelligence for questions about specific companies. Use Daily Brief when reps want their morning briefing or market update.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_1</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction 1</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>TRIGGER PHRASES that indicate Account Research: &quot;tell me about [company]&quot;, &quot;what do we know about&quot;, &quot;background on&quot;, &quot;brief me on&quot;, &quot;company intel&quot;, &quot;research on&quot;, &quot;what is their situation&quot;, &quot;prepare me for my meeting at&quot;. TRIGGER PHRASES for Daily Brief: &quot;give me my daily brief&quot;, &quot;what is happening today&quot;, &quot;morning briefing&quot;, &quot;market update&quot;, &quot;what is the news&quot;, &quot;catch me up&quot;, &quot;start my day&quot;.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_2</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction 2</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>CRITICAL EXCLUSIONS - Route elsewhere if user mentions: (1) deal, opportunity, pipeline, stage, amount, forecast, close date, commit, products on deal, line items, whats on the deal -&gt; Pipeline and Deals. (2) log, record, had a meeting, visited, called, met with -&gt; Activity Logging. (3) update contact, create account, modify case -&gt; CRM Data Management. (4) products on [company name], whats on [deal name], show me the products -&gt; Pipeline and Deals (these are opportunity line item requests, NOT company research). This topic is ONLY for retrieving pre-gathered intelligence, not for any CRM operations, activity logging, or deal/product management.</description>
