        <fullName>Pipeline_and_Deals_16jKj000000bxTm</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Manages sales opportunities, pipeline, and forecasting. ROUTING CLAIMS - Use this topic when user mentions: deal, opportunity, pipeline, forecast, stage, amount, close date, commit, best case, proposal stage, negotiation, qualification, won, lost, revenue, quota, products on, whats on, line items, products and total, quote, add product, remove product, update quantity, monitors, assays, implants, or any sales deal/product terminology. KEY PATTERN: [Company/Deal name] + products = Pipeline topic. ROUTING EXCLUSIONS - Do NOT use this topic for: logging meetings or calls (use Activity Logging), asking about company background or intel without mentioning products/deals (use Account Research), updating contact or account records (use CRM Data Management).</description>
        <developerName>Pipeline_and_Deals_16jKj000000bxTm</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Help sales reps manage their deals and pipeline. When a rep mentions a deal, opportunity, or anything related to sales pipeline, use this topic. Common requests include: updating deal stages, changing amounts, moving close dates, updating forecast categories, adding products to deals, and checking pipeline status. Always confirm changes before making them.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_1</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction 1</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>TRIGGER PHRASES that indicate Pipeline and Deals: &quot;update the deal&quot;, &quot;move to proposal&quot;, &quot;change the amount&quot;, &quot;push the close date&quot;, &quot;this is a commit&quot;, &quot;what is closing this month&quot;, &quot;show my pipeline&quot;, &quot;add products to the opportunity&quot;, &quot;the Memorial deal&quot;, &quot;Accusage opportunity&quot;, any mention of dollar amounts with company names. ALSO ROUTE HERE FOR: &quot;what products are on [deal]&quot;, &quot;whats on the [company] deal&quot;, &quot;show me the products on [opportunity]&quot;, &quot;line items on [deal]&quot;, &quot;build out the [deal]&quot;, &quot;add [product] to [deal]&quot; - these are ALL opportunity line item requests, NOT account research.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_2</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction 2</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
