            <functionName>Agentforce_Opportunity_Action_179Kj000000t668</functionName>
        </localActionLinks>
        <localActions>
            <fullName>Agentforce_Opportunity_Action_179Kj000000t668</fullName>
            <description>PIPELINE MANAGEMENT for sales reps. CRITICAL ROUTING: For SUMMARY/TOTAL/COUNT questions, use AGGREGATE operation (not FIND). AGGREGATE TRIGGERS: &quot;total pipeline&quot;, &quot;how many deals&quot;, &quot;how much&quot;, &quot;average deal&quot;, &quot;biggest deal&quot;, &quot;pipeline by stage&quot;, &quot;count&quot;, &quot;sum&quot;, &quot;number of&quot; -&gt; operation=aggregate. AGGREGATE SETUP: aggregateFunction=SUM for totals, COUNT for counts, AVG for averages, MAX for biggest, MIN for smallest. aggregateField=Amount for dollar values, Id for counting records. groupByFieldsJson=[&quot;StageName&quot;] for &quot;by stage&quot;. DATE FILTERING: ALWAYS set dateRangeField=CloseDate when user mentions dates. For &quot;this month/quarter&quot; use dateRangePredefined=THIS_MONTH or THIS_QUARTER. FOR SPECIFIC MONTHS like &quot;March&quot; or &quot;January 2026&quot;: use dateRangeStart and dateRangeEnd with YYYY-MM-DD format. EXAMPLE: &quot;March 2026&quot; -&gt; dateRangeField=CloseDate dateRangeStart=2026-03-01 dateRangeEnd=2026-03-31. &quot;February&quot; -&gt; dateRangeStart=2026-02-01 dateRangeEnd=2026-02-28. AGGREGATE EXAMPLES: &quot;Total pipeline&quot; -&gt; aggregateFunction=SUM aggregateField=Amount. &quot;Pipeline for March&quot; -&gt; aggregateFunction=SUM aggregateField=Amount dateRangeField=CloseDate dateRangeStart=2026-03-01 dateRangeEnd=2026-03-31. &quot;How many deals closing in Q1&quot; -&gt; aggregateFunction=COUNT aggregateField=Id dateRangeField=CloseDate dateRangePredefined=THIS_QUARTER. FIND TRIGGERS (list individual records): &quot;show me deals&quot;, &quot;list opportunities&quot;, &quot;what deals are in...&quot;, &quot;find deals&quot;. OTHER: CREATE new deals, UPDATE changes, DELETE remove. LINE ITEMS: addLineItemsJson to add products.</description>
            <developerName>Agentforce_Opportunity_Action_179Kj000000t668</developerName>
            <invocationTarget>AFOpportunityAction</invocationTarget>
            <invocationTargetType>apex</invocationTargetType>
            <isConfirmationRequired>false</isConfirmationRequired>
            <isIncludeInProgressIndicator>false</isIncludeInProgressIndicator>
